00:21:49,790 --> 00:21:51,850
You won't win! Ah!

269
00:21:52,690 --> 00:21:53,520
No!

270
00:21:55,830 --> 00:21:56,660
No!

271
00:22:04,510 --> 00:22:05,340
Luffy.

272
00:22:05,870 --> 00:22:07,170
You've been around!

273
00:22:09,730 --> 00:22:11,070
Horsy Bird, look!

274
00:22:11,230 --> 00:22:12,060
That's Luffy!

275
00:22:12,143 --> 00:22:13,170
He's falling!

276
00:22:16,830 --> 00:22:17,807
Oh no!

277
00:22:17,890 --> 00:22:19,030
Aissa and Pierre!

278
00:22:20,690 --> 00:22:21,520
Aissa.

279
00:22:21,603 --> 00:22:24,930
So that sly little voice
I've been hearing has a name.

280
00:22:26,150 --> 00:22:27,710
Find me, you coward!

281
00:22:31,410 --> 00:22:32,240
Luffy!

282
00:22:32,510 --> 00:22:34,007
We're coming to save you!

283
00:22:34,090 --> 00:22:37,710
I tire of this time to die.

284
00:22:46,790 --> 00:22:48,170
God's judgment?

285
00:23:04,090 --> 00:23:04,920
Luffy!

286
00:23:07,150 --> 00:23:10,290
I'm not here!

287
00:23:12,990 --> 00:23:15,210
For all my strength, he hurt me.

288
00:23:15,610 --> 00:23:18,990
Yet, here I stand, the victor.

289
00:23:29,690 --> 00:23:30,630
It's enormous.

290
00:23:32,350 --> 00:23:35,750
So this is the Ark the Divine
Squad was forced to build.

291
00:23:41,150 --> 00:23:44,150
Right here, on the northeastern
edge of the island.

292
00:23:44,410 --> 00:23:48,087
After the others get the gold, this is
where we're all supposed to meet up.

293
00:23:48,170 --> 00:23:52,027
And once all of you are together again,
you're planning to escape, right?

294
00:23:52,110 --> 00:23:56,051
As long as we have the treasure,
I'm not going anywhere without it.

295
00:23:58,330 --> 00:23:59,160
Nami...

296
00:24:00,010 --> 00:24:04,467
They're heading northeast towards the
seashore, no doubt returning to their ship.

297
00:24:04,550 --> 00:24:08,567
The smartest thing to do right now is go
on ahead and wait for them to show up.

298
00:24:08,650 --> 00:24:11,887
After all, they'll need me to
guide them back to the Blue Sea.

299
00:24:11,970 --> 00:24:14,499
I'm their best chance
to escape the island.

300
00:24:16,610 --> 00:24:19,670
But I have to get to the
Going Merry, and fast!

301
00:24:23,190 --> 00:24:24,020
Nami.

302
00:24:24,810 --> 00:24:26,230
You smell nice.

303
00:24:28,810 --> 00:24:29,640
No!

304
00:24:29,723 --> 00:24:30,553
It's not fair!

305
00:24:30,790 --> 00:24:33,908
One minute I'm dreaming,
the next I'm in a nightmare!

306
00:24:34,010 --> 00:24:35,510
Wait, hold on.

307
00:24:36,430 --> 00:24:37,260
Nami!

308
00:24:41,810 --> 00:24:42,640
What...

309
00:24:42,723 --> 00:24:43,830
what is that?

310
00:24:45,510 --> 00:24:49,467
Bellarine, Bellarine,
Bellarine, Bellarine,

311
00:24:49,550 --> 00:24:52,207
Bellarine, Bellarine,
Bellarine, Bellarine, Bellarine!

312
00:24:52,290 --> 00:24:53,120
Nami!

313
00:24:53,203 --> 00:24:54,270
She's in trouble!

314
00:24:58,070 --> 00:25:00,030
Hey, Usopp! Wake up!

315
00:25:00,370 --> 00:25:03,310
This is no time to be in bed, you idiot!

316
00:25:05,470 --> 00:25:06,507
What is it?

317
00:25:06,590 --> 00:25:07,450
What's wrong?

318
00:25:07,810 --> 00:25:09,450
Never mind that. Let's go.

319
00:25:10,830 --> 00:25:11,830
Go where?

320
00:25:12,170 --> 00:25:14,170
Where do you think to rescue Nami?

321
00:25:14,990 --> 00:25:15,970
Rescue, huh?

322
00:25:18,110 --> 00:25:19,350
Oh, yeah!

323
00:25:19,490 --> 00:25:20,687
It's all coming back to me!

324
00:25:20,770 --> 00:25:22,350
I remember everything!

325
00:25:35,770 --> 00:25:36,600
No...

326
00:25:36,683 --> 00:25:37,513
God came!

327
00:25:37,596 --> 00:25:38,426
Oh, nice, I angered God.

328
00:25:38,509 --> 00:25:39,339
Would you relax?

329
00:25:39,422 --> 00:25:40,267
He's long gone by now.

330
00:25:40,350 --> 00:25:42,267
This morning and say, how
can I get myself smooted?

331
00:25:42,350 --> 00:25:43,827
It's Nami who's in trouble.

332
00:25:43,910 --> 00:25:45,792
She's the one who got kidnapped!

333
00:25:46,210 --> 00:25:47,040
Nami?

334
00:25:48,110 --> 00:25:49,947
How could we have been so stupid?

335
00:25:50,030 --> 00:25:51,324
This is all our fault!

336
00:25:52,010 --> 00:25:53,827
She's too cute for this!

337
00:25:53,910 --> 00:25:55,430
Okay, so he took her.

338
00:25:56,650 --> 00:25:57,790
But where to?

339
00:26:02,030 --> 00:26:03,270
There! Huh?

340
00:26:07,050 --> 00:26:08,087
It... big...

341
00:26:08,170 --> 00:26:09,850
big ship... lying!

342
00:26:10,390 --> 00:26:15,050
Though I only saw her for a second,
I'm sure it was Nami on that ship.

343
00:26:15,630 --> 00:26:18,810
And while I may not know
what dangers lie ahead,

344
00:26:19,870 --> 00:26:22,267
at least she's not wearing
that T-shirt anymore.

345
00:26:22,350 --> 00:26:24,310
Again? With a t-shirt? Focus!

346
00:26:25,250 --> 00:26:27,550
I feel like I'm missing something here.

347
00:26:28,030 --> 00:26:30,677
Where are Conis, Weird
Night, and the others?

348
00:26:31,150 --> 00:26:34,030
I don't know, but we have to hurry.

349
00:26:43,550 --> 00:26:45,430
Hey, Sanji, where you going?

350
00:26:45,810 --> 00:26:48,970
To that ship, where else? Say what?

351
00:26:49,770 --> 00:26:51,910
Run faster or we'll lose him.

352
00:26:52,390 --> 00:26:53,930
My love needs us.

353
00:26:54,050 --> 00:26:57,547
Yeah, so, um, if I'm following
you, does that mean I'm going to?

354
00:26:57,630 --> 00:26:58,460
Of course!

355
00:26:58,543 --> 00:27:00,047
I need your help to get on board.

356
00:27:00,130 --> 00:27:01,927
You still have that rope
you shoot out of your belly.

357
00:27:02,010 --> 00:27:02,840
My Usafa!

358
00:27:03,770 --> 00:27:06,567
Oh, sure, I'll let you use
it while I wait down here.

359
00:27:06,650 --> 00:27:08,179
Just hurry up, you coward!

360
00:27:09,290 --> 00:27:10,407
Can it, moron!

361
00:27:10,490 --> 00:27:12,287
We don't have any more time to waste!

362
00:27:12,370 --> 00:27:15,710
I'm coming for you,
Nami, my beautiful swan!

363
00:27:16,510 --> 00:27:17,340
Swan!

364
00:27:22,950 --> 00:27:25,427
Now that the Archmaxim is activated,

365
00:27:25,510 --> 00:27:29,098
nothing can save this nation
from its inevitable destruction.

366
00:27:31,330 --> 00:27:32,227
What's wrong?

367
00:27:32,310 --> 00:27:34,545
You're lucky to have made it this far.

368
00:27:34,650 --> 00:27:37,167
Abandon all thoughts of
your incompetent playmates

369
00:27:37,250 --> 00:27:40,015
and embrace the glorious
future I've given you.

370
00:27:41,730 --> 00:27:42,767
Yeah, thanks.

371
00:27:42,850 --> 00:27:44,370
You're a swell guy.

372
00:27:45,810 --> 00:27:48,330
But one thing's more precious than gold.

373
00:27:48,830 --> 00:27:50,830
It's a treasure called friendship.

374
00:27:55,050 --> 00:27:57,290
We're gonna get some gold, yeah!

375
00:27:58,370 --> 00:27:59,488
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!

376
00:27:59,690 --> 00:28:01,370
And treasure! Tomorrow!

377
00:28:06,770 --> 00:28:11,490
What good is owning the world's
wealth without friends to share it?

378
00:28:12,370 --> 00:28:16,017
This island is filled with riches
I'd love to get my hands on.

379
00:28:16,210 --> 00:28:20,747
But sacrificing my friends and enduring
your ego is too steep a price to pay.

380
00:28:20,830 --> 00:28:26,887
So your treasure it's yours I don't

381
00:28:26,970 --> 00:28:31,850
want it really you don't want anything?

382
00:28:38,590 --> 00:28:41,330
Not even your life!

383
00:28:44,330 --> 00:28:45,650
Calm down, Sue.

384
00:28:45,970 --> 00:28:47,264
Tell me what happened.

385
00:28:50,970 --> 00:28:55,146
But wait, neither Sanji nor Usopp
are in any shape to be moving around.

386
00:28:55,550 --> 00:28:56,890
Why aren't they here?

387
00:28:58,930 --> 00:29:00,150
Where did they go?

388
00:29:01,290 --> 00:29:02,650
Come on, tell me.

389
00:29:06,510 --> 00:29:11,247
Sanji woke up and then
he woke up Usopp and

390
00:29:11,330 --> 00:29:17,910
they both ran and jumped
up to the...the ship?

391
00:29:18,170 --> 00:29:19,090
You're sure?

392
00:29:21,390 --> 00:29:23,470
But they're not fully healed.

393
00:29:24,190 --> 00:29:26,250
Oh, look at this place.

394
00:29:26,630 --> 00:29:27,830
It's a mess.

395
00:29:55,850 --> 00:30:02,470
God of the White Sea or not, if he lays
a finger on Nami, I'll be his personal

396
00:30:17,690 --> 00:30:20,770
Luffy, I need to borrow
some of your courage.

397
00:30:32,470 --> 00:30:35,650
from home, gazing not at the sky.

398
00:30:35,910 --> 00:30:38,430
You are just like the moon.

399
00:30:38,710 --> 00:30:42,950
You'll never change as
you're climbing to the night.

400
00:30:47,150 --> 00:30:49,890
But your reflection wanes.

401
00:30:50,030 --> 00:30:54,290
Then you disappear, fading so silently.

402
00:30:55,730 --> 00:30:58,150
Stay as you are.

403
00:30:58,630 --> 00:31:00,647
Don't move your way.

404
00:31:00,730 --> 00:31:03,827
Let these words guide you.

405
00:31:03,910 --> 00:31:08,210
Don't ever look back.

406
00:31:09,870 --> 00:31:13,207
Don't give up on your dreams.

407
00:31:13,290 --> 00:31:15,867
Their endless nights, they come to you.

408
00:31:15,950 --> 00:31:18,607
Again and again.

409
00:31:18,690 --> 00:31:21,307
Until you see the journey through.

410
00:31:21,390 --> 00:31:24,147
You may not return.

411
00:31:24,230 --> 00:31:27,047
I hope that you learn.

412
00:31:27,130 --> 00:31:30,027
To put your past behind.

413
00:31:30,110 --> 00:31:32,750
And just keep moving on.
